<title>FINLAND: Stockmann says Jan sales rise 19.3 pct.</title>
<headline>Stockmann says Jan sales rise 19.3 pct.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-02-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish retailing group Oy Stockmann Ab said in a statement on Thursday its January sales increased 19.3 percent year-on-year to 688.4 million markka.</p>
</text>
